ORACLE 2026-11-16 IS DAY 1
GR8 DATE YYYYMMDD: 8 DIGITS = CURRENT-DATE
GR8 INTO 9(10): 00 THEN YYYYMMDD
GR8 INTO X(10): YYYYMMDD THEN 2 SPACES
GR7 DATE: 6 DIGITS = YYMMDD
GR7 INTO X(10): YYMMDD THEN 4 SPACES
GR7 INTO 9(4): MMDD
GR9 DAY: 5 DIGITS = YYDDD
GR9 INTO X(7): YYDDD THEN 2 SPACES
GR10 DAY YYYYDDD: 7 DIGITS = YYYYDDD
GR10 INTO X(9): YYYYDDD THEN 2 SPACES
GR12 DAY-OF-WEEK: 1 DIGIT, 1 = MONDAY
GR12 INTO X(3) AND 99: D THEN 2 SPACES, 0D
